Kinematic stretching of linear wave kinematics for cable-free.

Apply on top of cable-free-surface-buoy.patch (it uses the same source tree;
scripts/build.sh applies both, in that order). Changes solver/waves.c only:
WaveParticleVelocity and WaveParticleAcceleration evaluate the linear
kinematics at a stretched height, so they extend up to the instantaneous
surface instead of stopping at the mean water level. Method chosen at run
time with the environment variable CABLE_STRETCHING = wheeler (default),
vertical or none (stock Cable). See docs/STRETCHING.md.

